cation_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source-proof-reviewed"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"supplied-68-archive; local content and dependency review"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq\\mathbb N^{k+1}\">\\(R\\subseteq\\mathbb N^{k+1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\mathrm{RE}^{(k+1)}\">\\(R\\in\\mathrm{RE}^{(k+1)}\\)</span>；见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"913d52943499d039\" href=\"?note=913d52943499d039\" title=\"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set\">68-df-recursively-enumerable-set</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartRec}\">\\(\\mathrm{PartRec}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5f5b8b347f696f58\" href=\"?note=5f5b8b347f696f58\" title=\"68-df-partial-recursive-function-class\">68-df-partial-recursive-function-class</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_k\">\\(\\mathcal F_k\\)</span> 与有限元组连接见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c524671590651be2\" href=\"?note=c524671590651be2\" title=\"68-df-number-theoretic-function\">68-df-number-theoretic-function</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{PartRec}\\cap\\mathcal F_k\\;\\left[\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\{\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k:\\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle y\\rangle\\in R)\\}\\land\\forall\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\;(\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle f(\\vec x)\\rangle\\in R)\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{PartRec}\\cap\\mathcal F_k\\;\\left[\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\{\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k:\\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle y\\rangle\\in R)\\}\\land\\forall\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\;(\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle f(\\vec x)\\rangle\\in R)\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>14.3 Selector Theorem，印刷 p.50 / PDF p.59。将 R(x,y) 写为存在 z 的递归矩阵 P(x,y,z)，同时枚举候选 (y,z)，第一个检验成功时输出 y；不存在候选时发散。这里不要求选择最小 y，也不要求选择函数全定义，正是原书的 selector 语义。已核对原书以二元编码最小搜索给出的证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-number-theoretic-function","status":"resolved","id":"c524671590651be2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-number-theoretic-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set","status":"resolved","id":"913d52943499d039","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-partial-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"5f5b8b347f696f58","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-partial-recursive-function-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set","status":"resolved","id":"913d52943499d039","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N$，$R\\subseteq\\mathbb N^{k+1}$，$R\\in\\mathrm{RE}^{(k+1)}$；见 [[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]。$\\mathrm{PartRec}$ 见 [[68-df-partial-recursive-function-class]]，$\\mathcal F_k$ 与有限元组连接见 [[68-df-number-theoretic-function]]。","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-partial-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"5f5b8b347f696f58","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N$，$R\\subseteq\\mathbb N^{k+1}$，$R\\in\\mathrm{RE}^{(k+1)}$；见 [[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]。$\\mathrm{PartRec}$ 见